  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo al Sistema de Movilidad Urbana del rea Metropolitana de San Salvador (AMSS)  Segunda Operacin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Program for the Urban Mobility System of the Metropolitan Area of San Salvador (AMSS)  Second Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es mejorar la calidad del sistema de transporte pblico en el municipio de San Salvador Centro dentro del AMSS, siendo los objetivos especficos: (i) Aumentar la eficiencia del transporte pblico; y (ii) fortalecer el proceso de planificacin basado en datos para el sistema de transporte pblico del AMSS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to improve the quality of the public transportation system in the municipality of San Salvador Centro within the AMSS (Metropolitan Area of San Salvador), with the specific objectives being: (i) to increase the efficiency of public transportation; and (ii) to strengthen the data-driven planning process for the AMSS public transportation system.</narrative>
  </description>
